; TAG 28/1/15: commented out, the general rule in types-extraction does not include OBJ-MARK specification.
; TAG 12/01/15:  arabic does not have OBJ-MARK;
;When an NP in DEP2 is extracted the LOCAL values of DEP2 need to be set and linking has to occur 
;(instead of what happens in head-np-comp2-phrase)
;LHS 2207: took out the restriction of the head's case to acc (to enable 'hxlwm hmvrh hith')
;LHS 0210: put back the restriction of the head's case to acc because 'hxlwm hmvrh hith' isn't relevant to comp2 anymore.
;extracted-v-head-comp2-np-phrase := extracted-comp2-phrase & no-hcons-ccont-rule &
;  [ HEAD-DTR [ SYNSEM [ LOCAL [ CONT.HOOK.TOPREL.ARG2 #ind2, 
;				CAT [ HEAD v_pron_head,
;				      VAL [ S-FRAME arg2+,
;					    DEP2.DEP.LOCAL [ 	CAT [ HEAD noun & [ CASE acc ],
;                                                              
;                                                       	      VAL.R-FRAME no-arg ],
;                                                 	CONT.HOOK.INDEX  ref-ind & #ind2 ] ] ] ] ] ] ].

; TAG 28/1/15: commented out, the general rule in types-extraction does not include OBJ-MARK specification.
;LHS 1211: extraction for subject to object raising (the dep2 np)
;extracted-raising-head-comp2-np-phrase := extracted-comp2-phrase & no-hcons-ccont-rule &
